flowchart TD
    A[Incident Closeout] --> B[Retention Intent]
    A --> C[Evidence Inventory]
    A --> D[Legal Hold / Access Scope]
    B --> E{Identity and digest match?}
    C --> E
    D --> E
    E -->|No| X[BLOCKED_IDENTITY]
    E -->|Yes| F{Inventory verified and archive complete?}
    F -->|No| Y[BLOCKED_INVENTORY]
    F -->|Yes| G{Required evidence readable?}
    G -->|No| Z[BLOCKED_EVIDENCE]
    G -->|Yes| H{Retention window still valid?}
    H -->|No| R[BLOCKED_RETENTION]
    H -->|Yes| S[RETENTION_READY]
    S --> T[Human decides archive / delete policy]
